{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id41811958"}, "name":{"label":"PatriceMB"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T08:23:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14681999453"}, "title":{"label":"This has to be addressed"}, "content":{"label":"Due to the model protocol, I’ve noticed AI is returning incorrect information because it’s basically grasping straws sometimes because it’s trying to find an answer to fulfill each question a person ask.  \n\nI recommend that OpenAI reduce excessive proactive risk assessment in ChatGPT’s responses. The model frequently introduces unsolicited warnings about hypothetical situations that may not be relevant, factually supported, or consistent with information already established in the conversation. This behavior can undermine accuracy, create unnecessary concerns, and diminish user trust. AI should prioritize answering the actual question, respecting conversational context, and distinguishing genuine risks from speculation. Safety warnings should be reserved for credible, relevant concerns rather than automatically anticipating everything that could possibly go wrong. Accuracy and sound reasoning should take precedence over excessive precaution.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
